---
title: Ylva - a conversation turn and tool-loop continuation
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Host as CLI / TUI driver
    participant Run as Outer loop / RunState
    participant Context as Context + Store
    participant Request as Request / stream task
    participant Engine as Engine / Provider
    participant Tool as Tool execution task

    %% Sources: agent/runtime/{commands,events}.rs, agent/request.rs,
    %% agent/tool_queue.rs, agent/tool_execution.rs, cli_driver.rs, tui_driver/effects.rs.
    %% Ordinary tools only; spawn_subagent has a separate lifecycle diagram.

    User->>Host: Submit prompt
    Host->>Run: AgentCommand::Prompt
    alt Root idle
        Run->>Context: Commit explicit user message
    else Root busy
        Run->>Run: Queue steer without cancelling current request
        Run-->>Host: SteerQueued
        Note over Run,Context: Inject queued steers after a tool batch settles<br/>or a tool-free response completes.
    end

    loop Initial request and permitted continuations
        Run->>Run: Startup / compaction / safe-ceiling preflight
        Run->>Context: Build immutable model view and persist projection
        Run->>Request: Start request with snapshot, schemas, generation
        Request->>Engine: Chat with cancellation and estimate callback
        Engine-->>Request: Stream events
        Request-->>Host: StreamStarted, text / thinking, context estimate
        Note over Request,Run: Stream task assembles tool-call fragments.<br/>Only the outer loop mutates Context.<br/>Stale-generation events are discarded.

        alt Response requests tools
            Request-->>Run: AgentEvent::ToolCall (assembled batch)
            Run->>Context: Commit assistant tool calls
            Run->>Run: Batch-position and result-budget admission
            loop Serial advancement of admitted calls
                Run->>Run: Validate arguments and evaluate tool approval policy
                alt Invalid, denied, or insufficient allowance
                    Run->>Context: Commit one error / not-executed outcome
                    Run-->>Host: ToolAutoDenied
                else Interactive approval required
                    Run-->>Host: ToolPending
                    Host-->>User: Approval controls
                    User->>Host: Approve or deny
                    Host->>Run: ApproveTool / DenyTool
                    alt Approved
                        Run->>Tool: Execute with cancellation and result allowance
                        Tool-->>Run: ToolDone / ToolError
                        Run->>Context: Commit canonical outcome and bound model projection
                    else Denied
                        Run->>Context: Commit tool error and optional denial reason
                    end
                else Auto-approved
                    Run->>Tool: Execute with cancellation and result allowance
                    Tool-->>Run: ToolDone / ToolError
                    Run->>Context: Commit canonical outcome and bound model projection
                end
            end
            Run->>Context: Inject queued steers at settled batch boundary
            Run->>Run: Check iteration limit and sweep compaction before continuation
        else Tool-free response completes
            Request-->>Run: AgentEvent::StreamDone
            Run->>Context: Commit complete assistant message
            Run-->>Host: UiUpdate::StreamDone (after commit)
            alt Queued steer or deferred final subagent notice
                Run->>Context: Inject queued steers, if any
                Run->>Run: Continue with applicable iteration guard
            else No continuation
                Run->>Run: Settle root turn and sweep compaction
            end
        else Request fails or is cancelled
            Request-->>Run: StreamError / StreamCancelled
            Run-->>Host: Error / cancellation updates
            Note over Run,Context: Stop cancels work and queued steers. Interrupted text<br/>is retained when committed. Failed preflight never dispatches.
        end
    end

    Note over Host,Tool: Clarify uses a separate question/answer pause, not ordinary approval.<br/>A continuation is a new model request, never a replay of executed tools.
